sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as App (ap-southeast-2)
  participant Src as Source region endpoint
  participant Prof as Inference profile
  participant Dst as Destination region fleet
  App->>Src: InvokeModel / Converse with profile ID
  Note right of Src: IAM check, incl.<br/>bedrock:InferenceProfileArn
  Src->>Prof: Resolve in-region / apac. / global.
  Prof->>Dst: Route to a region with capacity
  Dst-->>Src: Generated tokens
  Src-->>App: Response
  Note over App,Src: CloudWatch, CloudTrail and invocation logs<br/>stay in the source region.<br/>Price is set by the source region.
  Note over Prof,Dst: Geo stays in the geography.<br/>Global can use any commercial region.
